@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# ─── Tokens (fill these in after running the login requests below) ───────────
@driverToken = PASTE_DRIVER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@riderToken  = PASTE_RIDER_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

# ─── IDs (fill in after each create step) ────────────────────────────────────
@commuteId = PASTE_COMMUTE_ID_HERE
@tripId    = PASTE_TRIP_ID_HERE

# ─── Coordinates (Real GPS in Kumasi) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Abuakwa Police Station (driver start / rider pickup)   6.701014, -1.715833
# Tanoso Market (rider intermediate pickup / drop-off)   6.700100, -1.683000 (3.6 km from start)
# Sofoline Station (driver end)                          6.699254, -1.650524 (7.2 km from start)
#
# NOTE: Driver in DB runs Monday to Thursday [1, 2, 3, 4] at 07:45.
# Use a weekday date matching recurrence (e.g., 2026-10-12 or 2026-10-13).


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 1 — Log in as the driver
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1a. Request OTP (driver phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneCountryCode": "+233",
  "phoneNumber": "200000001",
  "role": "driver"
}

###

### 1b. Verify OTP → copy accessToken into @driverToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneCountryCode": "+233",
  "phoneNumber": "200000001",
  "code": "PASTE_OTP_HERE"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 2 — Create the driver commute
###           Abuakwa → Sofoline, Mon–Thu, 07:45
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2a. Create commute → copy id into @commuteId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/commutes
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startAddress": "Abuakwa Police station, Kumasi",
  "startLat": 6.701014,
  "startLng": -1.715833,
  "endAddress": "Sofoline Lorry Station, Kumasi",
  "endLat": 6.699254,
  "endLng": -1.650524,
  "departureTime": "07:45",
  "recurrenceDays": [1, 2, 3, 4],
  "capacity": 3
}

###

### 2b. Confirm commute is active
GET {{baseUrl}}/commutes/{{commuteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 3 — Log in as the rider
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 3a. Request OTP (rider phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneCountryCode": "+233",
  "phoneNumber": "200000002",
  "role": "rider"
}

###

### 3b. Verify OTP → copy accessToken into @riderToken above
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneCountryCode": "+233",
  "phoneNumber": "200000002",
  "code": "PASTE_OTP_HERE"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 4 — Browse available commutes
###
###  Key matching rules:
###  1. lat/lng must be within 5 km of Abuakwa (6.701014, -1.715833).
###  2. date must match recurrenceDays [1, 2, 3, 4] (Mon–Thu, e.g. 2026-10-12).
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 4a. Searching at Abuakwa on Monday (2026-10-12) — Returns the commute ✅
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/available?lat=6.701014&lng=-1.715833&date=2026-10-12&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

###

### 4b. Searching at Tanoso Market (3.6 km away, along route) — Returns the commute ✅
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/available?lat=6.700100&lng=-1.683000&date=2026-10-12&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

###

### 4c. Searching on Saturday (today) or Friday — Commute WON'T appear (driver only Mon-Thu) ❌
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/available?lat=6.701014&lng=-1.715833&date=2026-10-10&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

###

### 4d. Frontend bug reproduction: mobile app sends hardcoded Accra mock coordinates (5.6051, -0.1757) ❌
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/available?lat=5.6051&lng=-0.1757&date=2026-10-12&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 5 — Book the trip
###           Pickup: Abuakwa
###           Drop-off: Tanoso Market (along the route)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5a. Book → copy id into @tripId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commuteId": "{{commuteId}}",
  "tripDate": "2026-10-12",
  "pickup": {
    "address": "Abuakwa Police station, Kumasi",
    "lat": 6.701014,
    "lng": -1.715833
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "address": "Tanoso Market, Kumasi",
    "lat": 6.700100,
    "lng": -1.683000
  }
}

###

### 5b. Drop-off before pickup in travel direction — should 400 ❌
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commuteId": "{{commuteId}}",
  "tripDate": "2026-10-12",
  "pickup": {
    "address": "Sofoline, Kumasi",
    "lat": 6.699254,
    "lng": -1.650524
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "address": "Abuakwa, Kumasi",
    "lat": 6.701014,
    "lng": -1.715833
  }
}

###

### 5c. Drop-off too far off route — should 400 ❌
POST {{baseUrl}}/trips
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commuteId": "{{commuteId}}",
  "tripDate": "2026-10-12",
  "pickup": {
    "address": "Abuakwa, Kumasi",
    "lat": 6.701014,
    "lng": -1.715833
  },
  "dropoff": {
    "address": "Far off route",
    "lat": 6.8500,
    "lng": -1.8500
  }
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════
###  STEP 6 — Inspect the booked trip
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════

### 6a. Rider view
GET {{baseUrl}}/trips/{{tripId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

###

### 6b. Driver view (their own commute's manifest)
GET {{baseUrl}}/commutes/{{commuteId}}/trips?date=2026-10-12
Authorization: Bearer {{driverToken}}
